### Create Task
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "title": "Test task",
  "summary": "Test summary"
}

### GetTask By ID
GET  http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get Task List
GET  http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Task
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Test update task",
  "summary": "Test update summary",
  "owner_id": 2,
  "created_at": "2025-08-09T10:16:15Z"
}

### Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}